target/
# Spark integration tests pin spark.sql.warehouse.dir under target/ so these dirs should
# never be created at the module root — but they CAN appear if a future test forgets the
# override, or if someone runs an interactive spark-shell from the repo root. Ignore
# defensively so an accidental run never pollutes the working tree.
